WEBVTT

01:47.080 --> 01:50.400
THE 16TH COLLEGE SPORTS LEAGUE
SANDA EVENT

01:50.480 --> 01:52.480
CHAMPION

02:48.680 --> 02:49.600
Get up.

03:15.400 --> 03:17.040
Her face! Her face!

03:17.720 --> 03:19.520
Help! Her face!

03:37.600 --> 03:39.880
She's not human!

03:39.960 --> 03:41.560
Nonsense!

03:41.640 --> 03:42.920
She's not human.

04:28.120 --> 04:29.680
For life's other lessons,

04:29.760 --> 04:31.440
you can learn them through hard work.

04:31.520 --> 04:32.720
You'll start as a newbie

04:33.320 --> 04:34.600
and become an old hand.

04:46.560 --> 04:47.680
The gene exam, however…

04:47.760 --> 04:48.680
COOL, HANDSOME

04:48.760 --> 04:50.560
…is like a lottery.

04:50.640 --> 04:51.800
And someone else picked it for you.

04:51.880 --> 04:53.480
CUTE, PRETTY

04:53.560 --> 04:54.760
Someone won the grand prize.

04:54.840 --> 04:56.360
SMART, CLEVER

04:58.640 --> 04:59.520
But I…

04:59.600 --> 05:01.280
DNA, CONGRATS ON WINNING
THE PARTICIPATION PRIZE

05:01.360 --> 05:03.960
I got the participation prize.

05:07.960 --> 05:10.440
But from childhood to now,

05:10.520 --> 05:11.880
my dad always told me…

05:11.960 --> 05:13.320
Teacher, I'm done.

05:13.840 --> 05:15.440
Come on! Come on!

05:15.520 --> 05:17.400
…that losing is just a result.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.960
Life is about the process.

05:19.560 --> 05:20.680
Just do your best.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.200
Losing doesn't matter.

05:27.280 --> 05:28.680
You just need to try your best.

05:55.120 --> 05:59.840
THREE MONTHS AGO

06:45.480 --> 06:46.320
Are you okay?

06:47.560 --> 06:48.560
I'm fine.

06:50.600 --> 06:51.440
Rest for a while.

06:54.320 --> 06:55.800
ZHOU JINLI

07:00.280 --> 07:01.800
I don't mind you retouching the photo,

07:01.880 --> 07:02.920
but don't just retouch yourself.

07:03.000 --> 07:04.120
Come on.

07:04.200 --> 07:07.320
Do you and Tang need that?

07:10.080 --> 07:12.280
What kind of girl do you like?
Let Gu Yu introduce one to you.

07:13.160 --> 07:15.320
Why me? Why don't you introduce one?

07:15.400 --> 07:17.680
- You know a lot of girls.
- Cut it out.

07:20.760 --> 07:23.200
Ninety-seven photos,
including group photos.

07:23.920 --> 07:26.160
There are 58 women and 16 men.

07:26.240 --> 07:28.920
Fifteen women wore heavy makeup.
Forty-one women wore light makeup.

07:29.000 --> 07:31.920
Six men did eyebrow
and skin tone adjustments.

07:32.000 --> 07:33.800
The usage rate of beauty products

07:33.880 --> 07:35.960
is 83.78%.

07:37.160 --> 07:38.840
You wanted him as a partner

07:38.920 --> 07:40.280
because of his IQ, right?

07:40.360 --> 07:42.160
Your Moments can't speak for everyone.

07:42.240 --> 07:43.640
But it still shows

07:43.720 --> 07:46.520
that the seemingly saturated beauty market

07:46.600 --> 07:47.760
is still a blue ocean.

07:48.440 --> 07:49.600
Let's not talk about work for now.

07:49.680 --> 07:51.520
These photos in Moments are retouched?

07:51.600 --> 07:53.080
Can you even tell that by looking?

07:53.160 --> 07:54.640
Fake is always fake.

07:54.720 --> 07:55.800
Is this fake?

07:56.720 --> 07:58.520
Why can your eyes do that?

07:58.600 --> 07:59.880
This is…

08:01.600 --> 08:02.600
too sharp.

08:06.680 --> 08:08.680
Didn't you say the Marketing Department
was understaffed?

08:08.760 --> 08:10.080
Have you found the right person?

08:10.160 --> 08:11.000
Not yet.

08:11.680 --> 08:13.720
Beauty products sell beauty.

08:13.800 --> 08:16.280
I hope the Marketing Department staff
can not only work hard,

08:16.360 --> 08:17.920
but also have a good appearance,

08:18.920 --> 08:20.960
so they can be persuasive
when meeting clients.

08:21.040 --> 08:23.680
You're hiring employees,
not holding a beauty contest.

08:23.760 --> 08:25.920
If we can't find the right person
within a week,

08:26.440 --> 08:28.360
just hire an intern who can work.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.920
Are you going to interview for Vandai?

08:48.360 --> 08:49.480
Yeah. How about you?

08:49.560 --> 08:50.480
Me too.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.200
Me too.

08:55.280 --> 08:58.120
I'm also going to Vandai
for the Marketing Department interview.

09:02.880 --> 09:04.040
- OK.
- OK.

09:11.800 --> 09:13.800
- Ladies first.
- Thank you.

09:18.240 --> 09:19.200
Gentlemen first.

09:32.920 --> 09:33.800
Please sit.

09:37.840 --> 09:39.440
Please wait here for a moment.

09:39.520 --> 09:40.680
The interviewer will be here soon.

09:53.000 --> 09:54.400
Compared to the other two,

09:55.000 --> 09:57.920
Su Chengcheng's written test score
is a bit lower,

09:58.800 --> 10:00.960
but she performed the best
during the phone interview.

10:01.040 --> 10:02.040
She's very approachable.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.360
She has a talent for marketing.

10:04.000 --> 10:06.320
We'll know whether she's a talent soon.

10:11.000 --> 10:11.880
Aren't there three candidates?

10:13.440 --> 10:14.280
Hello.

10:14.800 --> 10:16.000
I'm Su Chengcheng.

10:26.760 --> 10:28.160
SU CHENGCHENG, JOB INTENT, MARKETING

10:41.400 --> 10:42.880
Your photo is overdone.

10:42.960 --> 10:44.640
You look nothing like this.

10:45.520 --> 10:47.600
Sorry, I won't do it again next time.

10:47.680 --> 10:49.000
You can go home and wait.

10:52.000 --> 10:52.960
Only me?

10:53.040 --> 10:55.080
Only you, Su Chengcheng.

10:56.280 --> 10:58.920
I'm here for an interview.
You didn't even ask me a question.

10:59.520 --> 11:00.960
Everything about you is wrong.

11:01.800 --> 11:02.760
What more do we need to ask you?

11:04.440 --> 11:06.280
Don't delay our next interview.

11:08.360 --> 11:10.000
No, but…

11:10.080 --> 11:12.320
Su Chengcheng, we have the result.

11:12.400 --> 11:13.680
You can go home.

11:42.040 --> 11:45.720
In the beauty market,
we sell beauty and create fashion.

11:45.800 --> 11:47.880
The Marketing Department
represents the brand image.

11:47.960 --> 11:51.400
Someone like her
is too far from our brand attributes.

11:51.480 --> 11:53.040
She's not persuasive for promotion.

11:54.280 --> 11:55.720
Please introduce yourselves.

12:09.160 --> 12:11.000
What do you want to do?

12:17.400 --> 12:19.680
Eat more fruit. It helps with bad breath.

12:20.400 --> 12:21.640
Whether I'm persuasive enough

12:21.720 --> 12:23.800
is not only up to you.

12:23.880 --> 12:27.080
You're the interviewer, but you
can't decide what the market likes.

12:38.800 --> 12:39.880
She has a strong grip.

13:01.040 --> 13:03.400
Is the interview over?
Contact me when it's over.

13:18.520 --> 13:19.440
How was the interview?

13:22.640 --> 13:25.280
The interviewer didn't think my image
met their requirements.

13:25.360 --> 13:28.360
They just sent me off
without asking me a question.

13:28.440 --> 13:31.520
Did the interviewer criticize
the photo I edited for you?

13:33.480 --> 13:34.600
Of course not.

13:35.400 --> 13:36.800
Didn't you say it?

13:36.880 --> 13:39.040
Everyone beautifies themselves
on their resumes.

13:39.640 --> 13:41.400
Interviewers are used to it.

13:42.000 --> 13:44.800
Are these interviewers
choosing beauty queens or employees?

13:44.880 --> 13:46.080
Why do they care so much about appearance?

13:46.160 --> 13:47.200
Where are you?

13:47.280 --> 13:49.360
I'll come find you at noon
to treat you to lunch.

13:50.280 --> 13:52.680
I have some things to do.
Let's talk another time.

14:30.600 --> 14:32.600
Buddy, do you want a can?

14:41.560 --> 14:43.640
What's in your bag is just like mine.

14:44.520 --> 14:45.920
It's a stack of resumes.

14:46.720 --> 14:48.640
We're both in the same boat.

14:57.560 --> 15:00.440
I just spoke to my best friend.
You probably heard everything.

15:01.920 --> 15:03.840
I don't have anything to do at noon.

15:04.640 --> 15:05.760
I just can't eat.

15:07.320 --> 15:09.800
I don't want her to rack her brains
trying to comfort me.

15:10.520 --> 15:13.080
It's not my fault
I'm not good-looking enough.

15:13.600 --> 15:15.520
But why does everyone have to comfort me

15:15.600 --> 15:17.760
because of it?

15:18.360 --> 15:19.600
The more they comfort me,

15:19.680 --> 15:21.640
the more it feels like it is my problem.

15:31.000 --> 15:34.360
EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL
ALUMNI ASSOCIATION - INVITATION

16:44.400 --> 16:46.800
I once had a crush on someone.

16:47.400 --> 16:49.600
He was the best guy in our school.

16:52.120 --> 16:54.400
I wonder what he's like now.

16:55.280 --> 16:57.200
We probably wouldn't even
recognize each other.

17:02.040 --> 17:05.400
Miss, is this yours?

17:22.319 --> 17:25.040
SOMETHING LIKE AN AUTOBIOGRAPHY

17:27.640 --> 17:29.000
CHAMPION

17:35.520 --> 17:37.080
Chengcheng

17:37.160 --> 17:38.880
could've been a great athlete.

17:39.600 --> 17:41.280
She didn't keep going, though.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.280
What a pity.

17:47.160 --> 17:49.600
If she kept practicing like this,
she'd be like you.

17:49.680 --> 17:50.960
With a strong build,

17:51.040 --> 17:52.360
she won't be able to find a boyfriend.

17:53.560 --> 17:54.720
What's wrong with a strong build?

17:56.160 --> 17:58.200
Wasn't it because you liked
my strong build

17:58.280 --> 18:00.760
and felt safe with me
that you were with me?

18:01.440 --> 18:02.680
Stop it.

18:03.760 --> 18:06.080
Anyway, Chengcheng now
is stronger than me.

18:06.600 --> 18:07.480
Yeah.

18:08.000 --> 18:09.920
Her boyfriend won't have to worry

18:10.000 --> 18:11.680
about her walking home alone at night.

18:11.760 --> 18:12.640
Stop it.

18:12.720 --> 18:15.440
She's your daughter, not your son.

18:16.160 --> 18:17.040
Come on.

18:17.120 --> 18:18.520
Nowadays,

18:18.600 --> 18:20.000
men are fragile too.

18:20.080 --> 18:22.560
They need protection.

18:22.640 --> 18:23.920
Who needs protection?

18:25.080 --> 18:27.240
My daughter's home.

18:27.320 --> 18:29.120
Hurry and change into slippers.

18:30.160 --> 18:32.560
- Are you tired? Let me help you.
- I'm not tired.

18:32.640 --> 18:34.240
Who needs protection?

18:34.320 --> 18:37.040
- Your dad needs protection.
- Don't worry.

18:37.760 --> 18:40.040
- I'll always have your back.
- How thoughtful.

18:40.720 --> 18:43.040
You're back. What are you holding?

18:44.960 --> 18:46.360
Cosmetics?

18:46.440 --> 18:47.360
Where did they come from?

18:47.440 --> 18:48.600
Someone gave them to me.

18:48.680 --> 18:49.840
A guy, right?

18:54.400 --> 18:56.160
Why are they samples?

18:56.240 --> 18:57.400
A little petty.

18:57.480 --> 19:00.600
It's better to be frugal than wasteful.

19:01.440 --> 19:03.600
Maybe you should try dating him.

19:04.280 --> 19:07.880
Mom. He's a complete stranger.

19:07.960 --> 19:10.000
He didn't want them anymore,
so he left them for me.

19:10.080 --> 19:11.360
A stranger?

19:11.440 --> 19:13.160
Yeah, I never even saw his face.

19:13.240 --> 19:15.520
We didn't say a word. Wait.

19:15.600 --> 19:17.360
I said a lot,

19:17.440 --> 19:18.520
but he never responded.

19:20.200 --> 19:22.920
Who does he think he is,
ignoring my daughter?

19:23.000 --> 19:25.920
Chengcheng, you're still young.

19:26.000 --> 19:26.880
Don't rush into relationships.

19:28.200 --> 19:29.080
Chengcheng,

19:29.640 --> 19:31.600
I don't want you to marry too early.

19:31.680 --> 19:34.120
I hope you can spend more time with us.

19:34.200 --> 19:37.160
It's okay if you stay single
for your whole life.

19:37.240 --> 19:38.080
I'll take care of you.

19:38.160 --> 19:40.280
- That's right.
- I love you.

19:40.360 --> 19:41.280
So sweet.

19:42.200 --> 19:43.040
I need protection.

19:48.680 --> 19:52.480
Su Qingli, here's a gift for you.

19:54.480 --> 19:56.080
I don't need it. You can have it.

19:57.160 --> 19:58.920
I only use mega brands.

19:59.520 --> 20:00.480
You keep it.

20:06.560 --> 20:09.640
Don't just do makeup
and dress up your doll.

20:09.720 --> 20:12.120
You should put on makeup and dress up too.

20:14.360 --> 20:15.760
What are you doing in my room?

20:18.560 --> 20:22.000
Tired of my room's decoration.
I want to change it.

20:24.280 --> 20:26.120
Did you get the invitation
to the alumni meeting?

20:26.920 --> 20:29.520
- I did, but I'm not going.
- Why not?

20:29.600 --> 20:32.520
I don't have anyone
I have a secret crush on,

20:32.600 --> 20:33.680
nothing to go for.

20:34.200 --> 20:36.920
But as a divorce lawyer,

20:37.000 --> 20:39.680
it might be a good opportunity
to find some clients.

20:40.480 --> 20:42.760
Su Qingli, they're all your classmates.

20:42.840 --> 20:44.080
Can you have a little conscience?

20:54.000 --> 20:55.560
With my face,

20:57.120 --> 20:58.520
do I even need a conscience?

21:03.200 --> 21:06.160
Fine, you're pretty, so, you're right.

21:16.480 --> 21:17.600
Something Like an Autobiography.

21:19.080 --> 21:20.280
What's this about?

21:21.040 --> 21:22.360
I don't know.

21:22.440 --> 21:23.480
I just started reading.

21:34.040 --> 21:37.640
REGULATE ORGANS, REPLENISH QI AND BLOOD

21:50.920 --> 21:51.880
Oh my God.

22:25.760 --> 22:27.640
Su Qingli, are you opening the door?

22:27.720 --> 22:28.840
I'll open it

22:28.920 --> 22:30.920
tomorrow morning.

22:31.840 --> 22:34.800
Do you think a door can stop me?

22:41.720 --> 22:44.680
Mom! Mom! Su Chengcheng's
going to smash the door.

22:44.760 --> 22:48.080
Dad! Dad! Su Qingli's bullying me.

22:53.960 --> 22:54.800
Tattletale.

22:54.880 --> 22:56.680
They went out for a walk.

22:56.760 --> 22:57.800
Open the door.

22:57.880 --> 22:59.080
I won't.

23:17.520 --> 23:19.040
Su Chengcheng, this is your room.

23:19.120 --> 23:20.840
Fixing the door costs money.
Have you found a job?

23:30.120 --> 23:32.480
Su Qingli, listen to me.

23:32.560 --> 23:34.160
Whether the air conditioner
is fixed or not,

23:34.240 --> 23:35.480
you're going back
to your own room tomorrow.

23:37.400 --> 23:40.240
Got it. Good night, sis.

23:57.200 --> 23:59.120
SOMETHING LIKE AN AUTOBIOGRAPHY

24:04.360 --> 24:05.920
In the deep mountains,

24:06.000 --> 24:07.880
there's a special kind of frog.

24:07.960 --> 24:10.120
Compared to others of its kind,

24:10.200 --> 24:11.680
it's not only uglier,

24:12.480 --> 24:14.480
but it also has a few more legs.

24:15.400 --> 24:17.160
When people catch it,

24:17.240 --> 24:20.240
they place it in front of a mirror
or inside a glass box.

24:20.880 --> 24:23.920
When the frog sees its ugly appearance,

24:24.680 --> 24:26.960
it gets so scared, it sweats oil.

24:35.240 --> 24:38.480
WANG YUAN: SPEAK UP
IF YOU'RE GOING TO THE ALUMNI MEETING

24:38.560 --> 24:39.680
LIN SHUANGSHUANG: HERE

24:39.760 --> 24:40.720
ZHOU XIAOJIE: HERE
HAN LI: HERE

24:40.800 --> 24:42.360
HUANG SIQI: HERE
LUO GAOYANG: HERE

24:42.440 --> 24:45.600
PAN CHENGJI: HERE

25:35.000 --> 25:36.040
Lin Yuan.

25:40.080 --> 25:41.040
Thanks.

25:54.360 --> 25:56.960
The air conditioner repairman
won't come until tomorrow.

25:57.520 --> 25:58.960
Cover up and stay warm tonight.

25:59.040 --> 26:00.120
Don't catch a cold.

26:01.600 --> 26:02.520
Qingli,

26:03.400 --> 26:04.920
you know a lot of guys.

26:07.200 --> 26:09.680
Could you introduce a boyfriend
to Chengcheng?

26:10.280 --> 26:13.880
Look at you, changing boyfriends
one after another,

26:14.440 --> 26:17.520
but your sister hasn't even had a crush

26:17.600 --> 26:18.960
since she was little,

26:19.040 --> 26:20.880
let alone an admirer.

26:22.440 --> 26:23.720
Qingli,

26:23.800 --> 26:25.840
don't forget about this.

26:27.640 --> 26:29.120
Make sure your sister never finds out.

26:46.520 --> 26:48.200
She says

26:48.280 --> 26:50.280
I'm too young to date

26:50.360 --> 26:51.920
and they'll take care of me for life.

26:52.680 --> 26:54.440
As it turns out, it was all lies.

28:33.160 --> 28:35.080
I heard you have
an alumni meeting this weekend.

28:35.800 --> 28:36.800
Not going.

28:38.000 --> 28:39.000
Why not?

28:40.400 --> 28:42.040
In the best years of youth,

28:42.640 --> 28:45.480
wasn't there anyone
who stayed deeply in your memory

28:45.560 --> 28:46.920
and impressed you?

29:24.080 --> 29:25.960
Coming, coming.

29:26.040 --> 29:27.880
Wait. Listen.

29:33.600 --> 29:34.440
Really?

29:42.560 --> 29:45.600
Forget it. How could this be?

29:45.680 --> 29:46.840
So weak.

29:46.920 --> 29:48.320
I'm telling you.

29:57.800 --> 29:59.720
The impression was too deep

30:00.880 --> 30:02.680
for me to meet her again.

30:06.160 --> 30:07.120
Who is it?

30:10.560 --> 30:13.760
The most trouble-making
sports star from our school.

30:17.680 --> 30:19.200
Every school

30:19.280 --> 30:22.440
has a top student
who excels in academics like you,

30:23.400 --> 30:26.240
but they also have someone who looks good,

30:26.320 --> 30:30.000
doesn't study well,
and causes a lot of trouble.

30:30.720 --> 30:33.640
As for men, two tigers can't live
on the same mountain.

30:37.800 --> 30:40.720
In our school, the so-called troublemaker

30:42.080 --> 30:43.080
was a girl.

30:43.160 --> 30:44.320
A girl?

30:44.840 --> 30:45.680
Did she…

30:47.000 --> 30:48.200
bully you?

31:08.080 --> 31:12.040
I'm looking for a job.
I don't have time for that.

31:14.240 --> 31:15.320
Besides,

31:15.400 --> 31:17.600
do I really need
such an expensive new outfit?

31:18.120 --> 31:20.840
I got the news that Tang Qi is going.

31:21.360 --> 31:22.320
Impossible.

31:22.400 --> 31:23.680
It's true.

31:23.760 --> 31:25.400
I heard he didn't want to go at first,

31:25.480 --> 31:27.200
but the former principal called him.

31:27.280 --> 31:29.120
He agreed to attend the final dinner.

31:29.880 --> 31:31.360
Time is like pig feed.

31:31.440 --> 31:32.800
Let's go to the alumni meeting and see.

31:32.880 --> 31:35.440
Let's see how time has shaped
the top student.

31:39.120 --> 31:40.320
Even if we go,

31:40.400 --> 31:42.360
there's no need to buy new clothes.

31:42.960 --> 31:44.880
You need to socialize
now that you're working.

31:44.960 --> 31:47.400
Snobs judge you based on your clothes.

31:47.480 --> 31:50.200
Why are you saving money for me,
a famous Chinese cartoonist?

31:53.240 --> 31:54.840
I can't wear skirts.

31:55.680 --> 31:56.520
Okay.

31:57.560 --> 31:58.960
How about skirt pants?

31:59.040 --> 32:02.160
Everyone will dress up
to save face, spending all they have.

32:02.240 --> 32:04.160
Besides, there will be
so many people there.

32:04.240 --> 32:06.440
We'll just be background props.
No one will notice us.

32:06.520 --> 32:08.680
Come with me to join the fun.

32:08.760 --> 32:10.640
Come on, Chengcheng.

32:10.720 --> 32:13.320
Come on. Come on…

32:15.600 --> 32:16.480
Okay.

32:17.240 --> 32:19.600
Hello, miss.
My friend wants to try this on.

32:28.160 --> 32:30.560
Do I look strange like this?

32:30.640 --> 32:32.280
Of course not.

32:32.360 --> 32:34.200
It's perfectly normal. You look great.

32:37.760 --> 32:39.680
Are these skirt pants too short?

32:39.760 --> 32:41.280
Doesn't it make my legs look thick?

32:42.040 --> 32:43.560
This is called healthy.

32:43.640 --> 32:45.480
Looking like a stick isn't beautiful.

32:45.560 --> 32:46.880
That's sickly.

32:47.800 --> 32:49.440
Trust my taste. Let's go in.

33:10.960 --> 33:12.080
Let me help you.

33:16.920 --> 33:18.360
Same as always.

33:19.120 --> 33:21.440
Bro, I respect you. You're a real man.

33:22.120 --> 33:24.720
Sis, can't a girl be strong too?

33:32.560 --> 33:33.720
Slow down. Slow down…

33:37.280 --> 33:38.440
She's amazing.

33:52.520 --> 33:53.480
Thanks.

33:53.560 --> 33:54.520
No problem.

33:57.840 --> 33:58.960
I'm dying from the heat.

33:59.040 --> 34:00.160
Is it cooler?

34:50.239 --> 34:51.360
Hello, senior.

34:53.040 --> 34:54.199
Senior, long time no see.

34:54.280 --> 34:56.880
Why are you only coming now?

34:57.960 --> 34:58.920
Long time no see.

34:59.000 --> 35:00.040
Why are you here today?

35:00.560 --> 35:01.600
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

35:05.600 --> 35:07.640
I'm just checking the production date

35:07.720 --> 35:08.720
to see if any are expired.

35:09.880 --> 35:12.360
We have to check.
Last time, my editor drank expired drinks

35:12.440 --> 35:13.920
and had a stomachache all night.

35:17.080 --> 35:18.360
I thought you wouldn't come.

35:18.440 --> 35:20.320
- Tang Qi, long time no see.
- Long time no see.

35:28.680 --> 35:30.000
All these years,

35:30.080 --> 35:32.000
I haven't found a better opportunity,

35:32.560 --> 35:34.160
so I've just stayed here.

35:34.680 --> 35:35.800
Tang Qi, what about you?

35:35.880 --> 35:37.240
I heard you just came back from abroad.

35:37.760 --> 35:39.520
Which big company are you working for now?

35:40.360 --> 35:41.800
I'm at a small company.

35:45.640 --> 35:47.400
It's fine.

35:49.360 --> 35:50.240
I'm at a small company too.

35:50.960 --> 35:53.280
It might not sound impressive
like a big company,

35:53.360 --> 35:54.360
but as long as the team's reliable,

35:54.440 --> 35:56.240
you can make just as much.

35:57.280 --> 35:59.520
I heard you joined a startup.

36:00.080 --> 36:02.160
How much are the bonuses after one year?

36:02.760 --> 36:05.000
Only if the company doesn't close down
within two years

36:05.680 --> 36:06.720
will there be any bonuses.

36:11.200 --> 36:12.040
Come on.

36:12.800 --> 36:14.320
Let's take a picture together.

36:15.320 --> 36:17.120
Hey, Xingxing.

36:17.200 --> 36:18.480
Xingxing, take a picture for us.

36:19.040 --> 36:19.880
Okay.

36:19.960 --> 36:22.000
Tang Qi hasn't aged poorly.

36:22.080 --> 36:24.600
Go greet him and have a chat.

36:25.520 --> 36:27.040
Why?

36:27.120 --> 36:29.600
We're not in the same grade.
He probably doesn't even know who I am.

36:31.880 --> 36:33.360
I'll go to the bathroom first.

36:33.440 --> 36:34.320
Then just ask someone.

36:34.400 --> 36:35.800
Ask someone to take a photo for us, okay?

36:35.880 --> 36:36.840
You go.

36:38.400 --> 36:39.520
Hello.

36:40.160 --> 36:42.360
Hey, can you take a photo for us?
Thank you.

36:42.440 --> 36:43.400
Okay.

36:53.800 --> 36:56.280
One, two, three.

36:57.960 --> 37:01.480
One, two, three. Here you go.

37:02.160 --> 37:03.320
- Thank you.
- No problem.

37:05.880 --> 37:06.960
You…

37:07.040 --> 37:08.320
You're Su Chengcheng, right?

37:09.120 --> 37:10.640
The beautiful Su Qingli's sister.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.360
Yes.

37:12.440 --> 37:14.600
I'm a classmate of Su Qingli.

37:14.680 --> 37:15.840
Why isn't Su Qingli here?

37:17.040 --> 37:18.800
She's busy with work.

37:20.440 --> 37:24.120
I remember you were great
at sports. You're strong.

37:24.960 --> 37:27.480
Once, a girl got stuck
in the ladies' room by accident,

37:28.080 --> 37:30.200
and you ripped the door off
with your bare hands.

37:30.280 --> 37:31.360
Yes.

37:31.440 --> 37:32.840
I heard about it back then.

37:33.600 --> 37:35.760
I heard you got into college
because of your sports talent.

37:37.200 --> 37:38.920
Do you still work in sports?

37:40.520 --> 37:41.520
No.

37:42.720 --> 37:43.880
Then, what are you doing now?

37:44.520 --> 37:47.200
I'm doing marketing
at a cosmetics company.

37:48.520 --> 37:49.800
Which cosmetics company?

37:51.320 --> 37:52.200
Vandai.

37:53.520 --> 37:54.600
Vandai?

37:55.320 --> 37:57.080
My boyfriend works at Vandai too.

37:57.160 --> 37:58.160
What a coincidence!

37:59.640 --> 38:00.480
Louis.

38:01.000 --> 38:02.600
Louis, come here.

38:03.200 --> 38:04.520
Come here.

38:05.960 --> 38:07.160
This is my junior.

38:07.240 --> 38:08.960
You two are from the same company
and department.

38:09.040 --> 38:10.280
You must know each other, right?

38:15.000 --> 38:16.000
We've met once.

38:21.400 --> 38:23.880
I just had an interview
at Vandai a few days ago.

38:23.960 --> 38:25.800
Still waiting to hear back.

38:34.280 --> 38:37.240
Hey, Principal Liu…

38:37.320 --> 38:38.880
Do you guys remember Principal Liu?

38:39.480 --> 38:41.440
The one who always wore a baseball cap

38:41.520 --> 38:43.880
and hid in the shadows
to catch late students.

38:43.960 --> 38:45.880
- He'll be here today.
- Really?

39:20.320 --> 39:22.320
You're still good, Su Chengcheng.

39:22.840 --> 39:24.200
Show us how to open a beer
with your bare hands.

39:24.800 --> 39:26.560
Chengcheng, you can do this?

39:27.080 --> 39:28.200
- Do another one.
- One more, Su Chengcheng.

39:29.040 --> 39:29.880
One more!

39:29.960 --> 39:35.040
Su Chengcheng, come on!

39:36.440 --> 39:37.520
Do another one.

39:44.680 --> 39:46.800
See? I told you she could still do it.

39:47.400 --> 39:48.600
One more!

39:51.480 --> 39:52.840
That's awesome.

39:52.920 --> 39:54.680
One more!

39:54.760 --> 39:55.720
That's awesome.

39:55.800 --> 39:56.920
Wow!

39:57.520 --> 39:59.080
- Awesome!
- Wow!

39:59.160 --> 40:01.000
- Amazing!
- Chengcheng.

40:01.960 --> 40:03.120
My turn, my turn.

40:05.160 --> 40:06.000
Impressive.

40:06.720 --> 40:07.840
Help me open one too.

40:09.160 --> 40:10.560
Thanks.

40:12.560 --> 40:13.400
What's going on?

40:13.480 --> 40:15.880
Su Chengcheng's opening beer for everyone.

40:18.840 --> 40:20.000
Why are you zoning out?

40:21.320 --> 40:23.160
- I…
- Stop sitting there. You go open one too.

40:23.240 --> 40:24.640
- Go on.
- I…

41:08.120 --> 41:10.240
- Do you have any tissue?
- No.

41:37.120 --> 41:38.760
Can I take a picture?

41:51.320 --> 41:52.280
You…

41:53.880 --> 41:55.600
Why did you take a picture of me?

41:57.520 --> 41:58.680
You look so bad.

42:13.160 --> 42:14.120
Chengcheng.

42:16.960 --> 42:18.240
You go back first.

42:18.320 --> 42:20.160
I want to be alone for a while.

42:26.640 --> 42:28.320
- What's wrong with her?
- I don't know.

42:28.400 --> 42:29.240
Why does she look so messy?

42:29.320 --> 42:30.720
Her makeup's all smudged.

42:36.040 --> 42:37.520
Why did you take a picture of me?

42:39.280 --> 42:40.360
You look so bad.

42:45.440 --> 42:46.600
It's okay.

42:50.720 --> 42:51.920
It's okay.

42:54.240 --> 42:55.440
It's okay.

42:56.760 --> 42:58.280
It's okay.

43:49.120 --> 43:51.680
FLOWERS, 9.9 YUAN FOR A BOUQUET

44:29.160 --> 44:30.680
I'll take all these flowers.

44:40.520 --> 44:41.760
Here's 50 yuan.

45:38.040 --> 45:39.080
How much is this?

45:48.120 --> 45:48.960
It's really pretty.
